[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168779650","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109435#issuecomment-3168779650","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109435","id":3168779650,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68372C","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T17:17:33Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T17:18:16Z","body":"`AnimatedTexture` sets `resource_local_to_scene` to false by default, I suspect this is because it doesn't support being local. Note that `AnimatedTexture` is deprecated and is no longer fully supported, consider using other alternatives, see the [documentation](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_animatedtexture.html)\n\nSo unless this is a very trivial bug, and not intentional or a more complicated issue, it's unlikely to be fixed and it'd be better to look at better alternatives\n\nThis should be documented though if it is an intentional or known limitation","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168779650/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168787140","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109435#issuecomment-3168787140","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109435","id":3168787140,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6839rE","user":{"login":"naturally-intelligent","id":6783606,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODM2MDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6783606?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent","html_url":"https://github.com/naturally-intelligent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naturally-intelligent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T17:20:57Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T17:22:05Z","body":"It's deprecated but I'm not sure what replaces it.  For example what should be used instead to make an animated Line2D?\n\n(I read the documentation linked but didnt see a replacement suggestion)\n\nThanks for the speedy response!\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"r